# plantuml-extension/media/{app,menus,vendor} is generated by
# plantuml-extension/scripts/sync_assets.py and compared byte-for-byte by its
# --check mode (which CI runs to catch a stale mirror).
#
# Line-ending normalization would break that comparison: with core.autocrlf=true
# these files are committed as LF and checked out as CRLF, while the script
# always regenerates them as LF -- so a fresh clone on Windows would report the
# mirror as stale even though nothing had changed. -text disables conversion so
# they round-trip unchanged on every platform.
#
# Scoped to the generated subtrees on purpose; the rest of the repository keeps
# git's default behaviour.
plantuml-extension/media/app/** -text
plantuml-extension/media/menus/** -text
plantuml-extension/media/vendor/** -text
